    "result_text": "The change is complete and the test suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe task was to expose `checkDigit` \u2014 a single Luhn check digit computed over the digits of the `customerCode` \u2014 on the owner API response.\n\nChanges made:\n\n1. **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 Added a transient `getCheckDigit()` getter that returns the Luhn check digit of the `customerCode`, reusing the existing private `luhnCheckDigit(...)` helper. MapStruct auto-maps this getter to the DTO field by name, so the value appears consistently in both the create and GET responses.\n\n2. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added the `checkDigit` property (integer 0\u20139, read-only) to the `OwnerDto` schema so the generated DTO carries the field.\n\nThe single acceptance test (`AcceptanceTest.coreCheckDigitIsLuhnOfCustomerCode`), which recomputes Luhn from the returned `customerCode` and asserts the exact digit, passes, and the full `mvn test` run reports **BUILD SUCCESS** (Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0).",
